      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements\n1) Technical\n-> User can send msg\n-> Use can create group chat ( limit 100)\n-> User can send images, files\n\n2) Non-Techincal\n-> Messge send gurrentee\n-> Scale ( send 1M message per day)\n-> Network tolerance ( avaiablitiy)\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements\n1) Technical\n-> User can send msg\n-> Use can create group chat ( limit 100)\n-> User can send images, files\n\n2) Non-Techincal\n-> Messge send gurrentee\n-> Scale ( send 1M message per day)\n-> Network tolerance ( avaiablitiy)\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
