      "seed": 1130007145,
      "version": 601,
      "versionNonce": 404218965,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779512097548,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Write/read => 40/60 -> no cache is required.\n\nProblems\n1) when user if offline what will happen when he is online\n2) How user get message from where he last seen message.\n3) How group members received message.\n4) How kafka and db retains message.\n5) How in kafka cover each message means handle and deliver it to client.\n6) How kafka know which websocket will consume this message or say client.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Write/read => 40/60 -> no cache is required.\n\nProblems\n1) when user if offline what will happen when he is online\n2) How user get message from where he last seen message.\n3) How group members received message.\n4) How kafka and db retains message.\n5) How in kafka cover each message means handle and deliver it to client.\n6) How kafka know which websocket will consume this message or say client.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "avIu9v9Bu6OkX_QVwq6KR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1304.4762704031816,
      "y": -396.42848423548935,
      "width": 455.7397155761719,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b44",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 610180233,
      "version": 410,
      "versionNonce": 17233787,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779512097548,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Estimation\nUser table (each filed = 5 char so overall 1MB)\nMessage (max msg size = 100 char = 10 MB)\nChatGroup(each field = 5 char = 1 Mb)\n\nuser = 100 Million = 1 Million GB\nmessage = 1M/day = 1 * 10 * 365\n          = 100 GB /year storage.\nRegion based = 100 GB/year/region wise.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Estimation\nUser table (each filed = 5 char so overall 1MB)\nMessage (max msg size = 100 char = 10 MB)\nChatGroup(each field = 5 char = 1 Mb)\n\nuser = 100 Million = 1 Million GB\nmessage = 1M/day = 1 * 10 * 365\n          = 100 GB /year storage.\nRegion based = 100 GB/year/region wise.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
