      "text": "Design whatsapp\n\nRequirements\nFunctional\n1) user can send message\n2) user can create group chat (100 users/grp)\n3) user can send images.\n\nOptional\n4) encrypt and decrypt message\n5) user is online or offline\n\nNon-functional\n1) Message must send and received (gurentee).\n2) System can be scalable to handle messages.\n3) System must be provided high throughput.\n4) System must be available.\n5) System must provide all message when user\nis offline.\n\n\n \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design whatsapp\n\nRequirements\nFunctional\n1) user can send message\n2) user can create group chat (100 users/grp)\n3) user can send images.\n\nOptional\n4) encrypt and decrypt message\n5) user is online or offline\n\nNon-functional\n1) Message must send and received (gurentee).\n2) System can be scalable to handle messages.\n3) System must be provided high throughput.\n4) System must be available.\n5) System must provide all message when user\nis offline.\n\n\n \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
