      "text": "3) Message send by user and based on table mapping it will find users to whom send message. so websocket unknow so to identify which user\nconnect with which websocket identify by redis.\n4) For sending image: server will provide pre-signed url to user to push message directly into BLOB storage so which reduce overhead on chat server.\n",
